    {
      "type": "mechanism",
      "text": "Betaine HCl provides hydrochloric acid, temporarily lowering gastric pH. This increase in stomach acidity supports pepsin activation, protein digestion, and solubilization of minerals and vitamins. Unlike betaine (trimethylglycine) used for homocysteine reduction, betaine HCl is targeted at digestive enhancement."
    },
